    <description>The text of the form's final submit button. It shows on the review page and, when no review screen is on, on the Stages Mode overview button once required stages are complete or on the last visible page's forward button. Conditional page rules can hide the last page you built, so the form uses the last page the respondent can see. Blank uses that page's Button Label, then Submit. Picklist values, so Translation Workbench translates them.</description>
    <inlineHelpText>Choose the wording for the form's final submit button, such as Submit Form or Submit Application. It appears on the review page and, when no review screen is enabled, wherever the form is submitted. Leave it blank to keep using the last page's Button Label.</inlineHelpText>
